<p>I have to admit, I'm confused. So there is a shovel, if you touch it to the ground the skeletons of the two kids appear under. There is a ghost that tried to dig for them but now has given up? The fact that the ghost has given up seems random and out of place to me. I'd personally prefer if the ghost was somehow still around.</p>
<p>It feels like a test log would be in order. They could dig up the skeletons and touch the ground with the shovel and see if the skeletons disappear or if they are getting multiple copies. If they are the same skeletons, could they put something on one (like jewelry or clothes) and have that move as well?</p>
<p>No vote for now.</p>

